        Artificial intelligence is creating another layer of possibilities for education and digital work. AI-related tools can influence content creation, research, automation, productivity, information organization, and classroom preparation. Educators should still evaluate these technologies carefully and use them where they provide a genuine advantage rather than adding unnecessary complexity.
      </p>

